---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Dating Photo Lab"
  description="Dating Photo Lab explores how to create natural, believable photos through real moments, simple actions, and less pressure to look perfect."
>
  <main class="about-page">
    <section class="about-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>

      <h1>Photos should feel like you.</h1>

      <p>
  A good photo doesn't have to look perfect to feel right. Sometimes it just
  needs to feel like something that actually happened.
</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-content">
      <p>
        Good photos don't have to feel staged. They can come from ordinary
        moments, simple actions, and a little less pressure to look perfect.
      </p>

      <p>
  Our guides and tools start with the same idea: give people something real to
  do, instead of asking them to stand there and look natural.
</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>